Description: In-house 2D-lidar dynamic-obstacle detector and tracker for ProxMPC: a lifecycle node that clusters a LaserScan, associates clusters to IMM (constant-velocity / constant-turn-rate) Kalman tracks in a fixed frame, and publishes their position and velocity as a prox_mpc_msgs/ObstacleArray.
 License-clean (no third-party trackers).
